OL,3,GNEWSAGang jailed for drug dealing and
OL,4,Amoney laundering
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve people have been jailed for
OL,7,Ftheir roles in the "industrial-scale
OL,8,Fsupply" of Class A drugs across
OL,9,FYorkshire and beyond.
OL,11,FEleven men and one woman were sentenced
OL,12,Fat Bradford Crown Court on Monday, with
OL,13,F"ringleader" Idris Khan, 35, of
OL,14,FAshgrove, Bradford, sentenced to 16
OL,15,Fyears in jail.
OL,17,FThe Bradford-based gang were
OL,18,Fresponsible for the distribution of
OL,19,Fmore than 135kg of drugs, West
OL,20,FYorkshire Police said, after officers
OL,21,Frecovered 55kg of cocaine and heroin.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
