OL,3,GNEWSAGang jailed for drug dealing and
OL,4,Amoney laundering
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Kevin Daly described it as a
OL,7,F"sophisticated conspiracy", with the
OL,8,Fdefendants profiting "greatly from
OL,9,Fcriminality".
